{
  "id": 8867219570887,
  "title": "Softball Bedroom Decor Bedding Set – Vibrant Teal Yellow Sports Theme",
  "handle": "softball-bedroom-decor-bedding-set-vibrant-teal-yellow-sports-theme",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform any bedroom into a vibrant haven for softball enthusiasts with this lively Sports Theme Comforter Set from Jeminise. Perfect for girls, teens, and women who adore softball, this set combines comfort with a passionate display of team spirit.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Type:</strong> Comforter Set designed for softball players and fans.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Theme &amp; Design:</strong> Features a vibrant Teal Yellow Sports Theme, celebrating the spirit of softball.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm) for an ultra-soft, smooth, and durable feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Durability:</strong> Made with fade-resistant microfiber that is cool, breathable, and more durable than cotton.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Utilizes environmental protection techniques in the finishing process to ensure dye retention and prevent fading, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable and dries quickly; tumble dry low. For best results, wash in a mesh laundry bag.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Softball Design 05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Player</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Twin/Full/Queen/King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Fade Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Fall, Spring, Summer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
